# environment
.env
.env.local

# updater signing keys (ADR-024). The public half lives in
# src-tauri/tauri.conf.json; a private key in this repository would let anyone
# publish an update that installs. The real key is a GitHub Actions secret.
*.key
*.key.pub

# Android release keystore (ADR-025). Android refuses an update whose signing
# certificate differs from the installed one, so this one is load-bearing in a
# way a leaked key otherwise is not: losing it leaves every installed build
# unable to update, and uninstalling — the only remedy — deletes chayote.db.
# The real key is a GitHub Actions secret; this is the local working copy.
*.jks
*.keystore

# editor / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*